  "description": "Measures the sign of the two convention-D Toffoli amplitudes over the stability region asserted by prop:q-game-of-life. P_77^D has no positive root, so the golden-ratio threshold the q-GoL proof cites is a convention-C artifact; Phi^D is positive exactly on 0 < q < 1, so the region where both are strictly positive is 0 < q < 1 and the substrate q_0 sits where the q-AND is negative. Scope (a): what is excluded is the condition AS WRITTEN. Whether strict positivity or non-vanishing is the right condition is the author's call and is not settled here.",
